#                    service, so this makes umountroot the first filesystem step.
#                    / must become read-only while its backing exFAT volume is
#                    still writable, or the ext4 flush cannot reach the media.
#                    Should-Stop: halt reboot is the stock statement that the
#                    terminal scripts come after this one.
